# Styled authored phrases stay readable and accessible as plain text.
@scene opening
"The [[fx=ember]]fire[[/fx]] illuminates a [[fx=shadow]]secret[[/fx]] beneath the old observatory."
"Over the hillside, a [[fx=ember]]warm light[[/fx]] spreads toward the gate."
"Grandmother murmured: Buenas noches, おやすみ, नमस्ते. [[fx=shadow]]Quiet[[/fx]] now."
"The [[fx=ember]]flame[[/fx]] remembers yesterday. The End."
